- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/staff-domain/temporary-care-home
  route: staff-domain/temporary-care-home
  key: temporary-care-home
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:Circumstance
  label: Temporary care-home stay and continuing household
  definition: For a claimant with no partner whose normal home circumstances do not satisfy the additional-amount
    conditions, DMG 78084 says a temporary care-home stay does not itself change their normal residence.
    DMG 78085 retains household membership for a temporarily
    absent partner, but DMG 78086 requires a review of Pension Credit and the severe-disability addition if
    residential care exceeds 28 days and DLA payability ceases. The example continues on the next page. These
    are component and qualifying-benefit conditions, not a universal 28-day end to Pension Credit.
  aliases:
  - temporary care-home stay
  - temporary stay in a care home
  source_candidates: []
  required_source_ids:
  - https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0024
