- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/staff-domain/scottish-disability-carer-dependencies
  route: staff-domain/scottish-disability-carer-dependencies
  key: scottish-disability-carer-dependencies
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:Guidance
  label: Dated Scottish disability and carer dependencies for Pension Credit
  definition: The captured chapter must be read with its amendment memoranda. DMG memo 02/25 paragraphs 13–16
    add Pension Age Disability Payment (PADP) from 21 October 2024 to the AA meaning and
    qualifying/ignored-person provisions. DMG memo 06/25 paragraphs 30–33 add Scottish Adult Disability Living
    Allowance (SADLA) to specified Pension Credit disability and housing-cost provisions; its introduction
    gives commencement as 21 March 2025. DMG memo 01/26 paragraphs 5–7 amend Carer Support Payment (CSP)
    terminology and the specified bereavement run-on from 15 March 2026. Its paragraphs 5 and 6 use different
    component wording, preserved in the source and requiring legal reconciliation. Do not silently treat these
    benefits as synonyms in all rules or infer present entitlement from a capture date.
  aliases:
  - Scottish disability and carer dependencies
  source_candidates: []
  review_status: unreviewed-specialist-review-required
  additional_sources:
